ttp://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FZDgKv4g9ydvi2UMdRGW3wg\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ZDgKv4g9ydvi2UMdRGW3wg</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background: #FFF\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息192.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/7/7e/7wqg3rxspr8ssr5i5u99gd0u5952a2p.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF192.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"149\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7e/7wqg3rxspr8ssr5i5u99gd0u5952a2p.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"200\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<center>\n<p>团长好！这里是小场记（疯狂搬砖版<br />\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>北京核聚变游戏节</b></font>的第二天也顺利结束啦<br />\n今天又有什么新鲜的<font color=\"brown\"><b>瞬间</b></font><br />\n一起来看看吧~\n<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息175.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF175.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"75\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/87/6oybbjhh7pbos7f5bxlnv0h1c4t8xie.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"100\" />\n<br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息204.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/skonwb14oupz6uvsqlw3tvkpcudrt5x.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF204.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/skonwb14oupz6uvsqlw3tvkpcudrt5x.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF204.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/07/skonwb14oupz6uvsqlw3tvkpcudrt5x.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"719\" />\n<small><small><small>早早来到展台，等待团长的光临</small></small></small><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息205.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/02/fowbqfsp670gxgfxpod5i81rfjzkzns.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF205.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/02/fowbqfsp670gxgfxpod5i81rfjzkzns.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF205.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/02/fowbqfsp670gxgfxpod5i81rfjzkzns.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"719\" />\n<small><small><small>排队试玩的团长们</small></small></small><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息206.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cd/9zyjfkbjwy1u3brn8as3b39yevstccn.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF206.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"373\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/cd/9zyjfkbjwy1u3brn8as3b39yevstccn.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF206.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/cd/9zyjfkbjwy1u3brn8as3b39yevstccn.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"719\" />\n<small><small><small>等待途中交流游戏ing</small></small></small><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息207.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/82/hc7hopbw7zutcw8jzivo4lhbj641q8a.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF207.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"372\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/82/hc7hopbw7zutcw8jzivo4lhbj641q8a.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF207.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/82/hc7hopbw7zutcw8jzivo4lhbj641q8a.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"718\" />\n<small><small><small>现场体验游戏的团长</small></small></small><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息208.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9c/rtrf98wwtxny33salq2j5mhnbxnw6ct.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF208.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"372\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/9c/rtrf98wwtxny33salq2j5mhnbxnw6ct.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF208.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/9c/rtrf98wwtxny33salq2j5mhnbxnw6ct.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"718\" />\n<small><small><small>有伊利亚行为指南，轻松上手</small></small></small><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息209.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/91/ov0vysqb2brkjsos7yacwos0h552v9k.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF209.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"372\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/9/91/ov0vysqb2brkjsos7yacwos0h552v9k.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF209.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/91/ov0vysqb2brkjsos7yacwos0h552v9k.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"718\" />\n<small><small><small>工作人员也会进行耐心的讲解</small></small></small><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息210.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/9rmy0f2nv13bbeh7dvalz783eptf02y.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF210.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"372\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/9rmy0f2nv13bbeh7dvalz783eptf02y.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF210.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/10/9rmy0f2nv13bbeh7dvalz783eptf02y.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"718\" />\n<small><small><small>一起体验铃兰之剑更加有趣</small></small></small><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息211.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/36/hp2br633ojhgo25lb23al2a66as6150.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF211.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"372\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/36/hp2br633ojhgo25lb23al2a66as6150.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF211.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/36/hp2br633ojhgo25lb23al2a66as6150.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"718\" />\n<small><small><small>不要忘记带走角色立牌哦</small></small></small><br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息212.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/3m2an6csx0zsy0pjjecujj06hwm46ig.jpg/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF212.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"372\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/3m2an6csx0zsy0pjjecujj06hwm46ig.jpg/840px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF212.jpg 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/07/3m2an6csx0zsy0pjjecujj06hwm46ig.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"718\" />\n<small><small><small>下次再见啦</small></small></small><br /><br />\n</p>\n</center>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">场记小报</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n<p>本次核聚变游戏节-北京站<font color=\"brown\"><b>圆满落幕</b></font>啦（撒花~<br /><br />\n非常感谢前来线下体验的团长们，大家的<font color=\"brown\"><b>热情和支持</b></font>是赠予《铃兰之剑》最好的礼物。<br /><br />\n《铃兰之剑》将于<font color=\"brown\"><b>9月底</b></font>开启<font color=\"brown\"><b>极心测试</b></font>，本次测试为<font color=\"brown\"><b>付费删档测试</b></font>，具体测试信息将在近期公布。<br /><br />\n<font color=\"brown\"><b>为这和平的世界</b></font>，我们下次见！<br /><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163729\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.092 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 108/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2104/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 274/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.575      1 -total\n 57.22%   20.927      1 模板:文章戳\n 42.53%   15.555      1 模板:面包屑\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:3133-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022163729 and revision id 6678. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"新闻","missing":true}],"images":["官方消息192.png","官方消息175.png","官方消息204.jpg","官方消息205.jpg","官方消息206.jpg","官方消息207.jpg","官方消息208.jpg","官方消息209.jpg","官方消息210.jpg","官方消息211.jpg","官方消息212.jpg"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"核聚变游戏节-北京站 Day2","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"核聚变游戏节-北京站_Day2","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"核聚变游戏节-北京站_Day2"}],"displaytitle":"核聚变游戏节-北京站 Day2","wikitext":"{{面包屑|官方消息|新闻}}\n=核聚变游戏节-北京站 Day2=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=新闻\n|时间=2023-09-10 18:24\n|作者=在北京的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=官方微信公众号\n|原文地址=https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ZDgKv4g9ydvi2UMdRGW3wg\n}}\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\